{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "trove-api-collection",
    "name": "Trove API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the Trove Cloudflare Worker API.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Start the dev server: `pnpm dev:server` (listens on http://localhost:3000)\n2. Import `Trove-Local.postman_environment.json` and select it\n3. Run **Auth \u2192 Sign up** (first time) or **Auth \u2192 Sign in**\n4. Run **Households \u2192 Create household** \u2014 saves `household_id`\n5. Use **Commands** and **Ledger** folders for the sync path\n\n## Auth\n\nBetter Auth uses an httpOnly cookie (`better-auth.session_token`). Sign-in/sign-up test scripts capture it into `session_cookie`. Protected requests inherit it via the collection pre-request script.\n\nThere is no seeded user. Create one via Sign up.\n\nMagic-link and password-reset URLs are logged to the Alchemy worker console (`[Auth] Magic link for ...`).\n\n## oRPC\n\nAll business procedures are `POST {{rpc_url}}/...`. Nested router keys become slash paths (`households.create` \u2192 `/rpc/households/create`).\n\n`householdId` goes in the JSON body, not a header.\n\n## Commands\n\n`commands.apply` returns HTTP 200 even for `forbidden` and `invalid_intent`. Inspect `kind` in the response body.\n\n## Not mounted\n\n`budget/*` and `projections/*` routers exist in source but are not on `appRouter`. They 404.\n\n## Wire format (important)\n\noRPC Standard RPC does **not** accept bare JSON input. Wrap every RPC body as:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"json\": { /* procedure input */ }\n}\n```\n\nProcedures with no input use `{ \"json\": null }` or `{ \"json\": {} }`.\nAuth routes under `/api/auth/*` stay bare JSON (Better Auth, not oRPC).\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const cookie = pm.environment.get('session_cookie') || pm.collectionVariables.get('session_cookie');",
          "const url = pm.request.url.toString();",
          "const isAuthRoute = url.includes('/api/auth/');",
          "const isHealth = url.endsWith('/') && pm.request.method === 'GET';",
          "if (cookie && !isAuthRoute && !isHealth) {",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Cookie', value: cookie });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
